// go-codec is extracted from codec/ into a standalone repo. This replace
// directive redirects all workspace modules to the local directory until
// the repo is published on GitHub with a v0.1.0 tag. Once published, remove
// this replace and add `../go-codec` to the use block above (same pattern
// as go-retry and go-idempotency).
replace github.com/larsartmann/go-codec => ../go-codec

// The genproto replace resolves an ambiguous-import conflict between
// cockroachdb/errors (transitive from pebble, pulls the monolithic
// google.golang.org/genproto) and grpc-go (needs the split
// google.golang.org/genproto/googleapis/rpc). Pinning to this version —
// where the googleapis/rpc packages were already split out — eliminates
// the package overlap. This can be removed once cockroachdb/errors drops
// the monolithic genproto dependency (cockroachdb/errors#79).
replace google.golang.org/genproto => google.golang.org/genproto v0.0.0-20250603155806-513f23925822
